                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I love this game, so chill and easy to play. The puzzles are not too hard, but some still had me googling for an answer lol. The visuals are great and the atmosphere is very pleasant. It does have some down sides though, I wish they would have included locomotion so I didn't have to teleport everywhere. And the sound in the game is not great, the lantern near your head must be lit in order to see the game play spaces, but it is so loud that it almost hurts your head. A real bummer because it ruins the train ride parts. The volume slider is also weird, starts at 50%, but if you turn it up it risks blowing out the speakers! So be very very careful if you use the volume setting in the game!! \n\nAll in all, I wish there were more games like this for newer VR players. This game deserved more love and success than it received, what a pity many people never got to try it. Will there be a part 2? probably not :(\n\nI hope one day the devs will revisit this and fix the few small problems, so that it could be enjoyed by more people.\\\n\nGreat little train game.",
